<view class="page">
  <view class="group">
    <view class="g-title">学期与课表</view>
    <picker mode="date" value="{{dateValue}}" bindchange="onDate">
      <view class="row">
        <text class="r-label">学期开始日期（第一周周一）</text>
        <text class="r-val">{{s.semesterStart}}</text>
        <text class="r-arrow">›</text>
      </view>
    </picker>
    <picker mode="selector" range="{{weeksOptions}}" bindchange="onWeeks">
      <view class="row">
        <text class="r-label">学期总周数</text>
        <text class="r-val">{{s.totalWeeks}} 周</text>
        <text class="r-arrow">›</text>
      </view>
    </picker>
    <picker mode="selector" range="{{periodsOptions}}" bindchange="onPeriods">
      <view class="row">
        <text class="r-label">每天节次数</text>
        <text class="r-val">{{s.periodCount}} 节</text>
        <text class="r-arrow">›</text>
      </view>
    </picker>
  </view>

  <view class="group">
    <view class="g-title">上课时间（每个小节的开始时刻）</view>
    <picker wx:for="{{timeRows}}" wx:key="key" mode="time" value="{{item.time}}" data-idx="{{index}}" bindchange="onPeriodTime">
      <view class="row">
        <text class="r-label">第 {{item.no}} 节</text>
        <text class="r-val">{{item.time}}</text>
        <text class="r-arrow">›</text>
      </view>
    </picker>
    <view class="row" bindtap="resetTimes">
      <text class="r-label">恢复默认作息</text>
      <text class="r-arrow">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="hint">默认按“1 大节＝2 小节、每小节 45 分钟”：上午 8:00 / 10:05，下午 14:00 / 16:05，晚 19:00 / 20:05。各校作息不同，点上面的时间即可修改。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="group">
    <view class="g-title">课前提醒（每日 7 点推送今日课程）</view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="r-label">开启课前提醒</text>
      <switch checked="{{remindOn}}" bindchange="toggleRemind" color="#2f6fed" />
    </view>
    <view class="row" bindtap="addRemindQuota">
      <text class="r-label">续订提醒次数（多点几次）</text>
      <text class="r-arrow">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="hint">微信订阅消息每次授权只能推 1 条：开启后如需每天提醒，隔几天点一次"续订"积累次数。推送为微信"服务通知"（有横幅和声音，效果接近闹钟）。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="group">
    <view class="g-title">云同步（跨设备备份）</view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="r-label">开启云同步</text>
      <switch checked="{{cloudEnabled}}" bindchange="toggleCloud" color="#2f6fed" />
    </view>
    <view class="row" bindtap="restoreFromCloud">
      <text class="r-label">从云端恢复数据</text>
      <text class="r-arrow">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="r-label">同步状态</text>
      <text class="r-val">{{cloudStatusText}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="hint">开启后，课表/成绩/设置会同步到云端（仅本人可见）。换手机、删小程序、重装微信都不丢数据。本地数据始终优先，离线也能用。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="group">
    <view class="g-title">数据备份</view>
    <view class="row" bindtap="exportAll">
      <text class="r-label">导出全部数据（生成备份码）</text>
      <text class="r-arrow">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="row" bindtap="showImport">
      <text class="r-label">从备份码恢复</text>
      <text class="r-arrow">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="row" bindtap="showSnapshots">
      <text class="r-label">历史快照（自动备份）</text>
      <text class="r-val" wx:if="{{snapCount}}">{{snapCount}} 份</text>
      <text class="r-arrow">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="row" bindtap="clearCourses">
      <text class="r-label danger">清空课表数据</text>
      <text class="r-arrow">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="row" bindtap="clearGrades">
      <text class="r-label danger">清空成绩数据</text>
      <text class="r-arrow">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="hint">每次课表/成绩变动会自动保存最近 5 份历史快照，误删、误清后可从「历史快照」找回。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="group">
    <view class="g-title">关于</view>
    <view class="about">My Class课助 v1.0
数据仅保存在你的手机本机，不上传、不收集任何个人信息。
换手机前，请先在「数据备份」导出备份码，在新手机上恢复。</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 备份码展示 -->
  <view class="mask" wx:if="{{shareShow}}" bindtap="closeShare">
    <view class="panel" catchtap="noop">
      <view class="p-title">备份码</view>
      <view class="share-hint">包含课表、成绩和设置。复制保存到微信收藏/备忘录，换手机时粘贴恢复。</view>
      <textarea class="share-area" value="{{shareCode}}" maxlength="-1" disabled="{{true}}"></textarea>
      <view class="p-btns">
        <view class="btn-ghost" bindtap="closeShare">关闭</view>
        <view class="btn-primary" bindtap="copyCode">复制备份码</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 备份恢复 -->
  <view class="mask" wx:if="{{importShow}}" bindtap="closeImport">
    <view class="panel" catchtap="noop">
      <view class="p-title">恢复备份</view>
      <textarea class="imp-area" value="{{importText}}" bindinput="onImportText" maxlength="-1" placeholder="粘贴之前导出的备份码"></textarea>
      <view class="p-btns">
        <view class="btn-ghost" bindtap="closeImport">取消</view>
        <view class="btn-primary" bindtap="doImport">恢复数据</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 历史快照 -->
  <view class="mask" wx:if="{{snapShow}}" bindtap="closeSnapshots">
    <view class="panel" catchtap="noop">
      <view class="p-title">历史快照</view>
      <view class="share-hint" wx:if="{{snapList.length}}">恢复后当前课表/成绩会被快照内容替换；之前的当前数据若比最新快照新，恢复前可先「导出全部数据」留存。</view>
      <view class="snap-empty" wx:if="{{!snapList.length}}">暂无快照。课表或成绩变动后会自动留底。</view>
      <view class="snap-list" wx:if="{{snapList.length}}">
        <view class="snap-item" wx:for="{{snapList}}" wx:key="t">
          <view class="snap-info">
            <text class="snap-time">{{item.timeText}}</text>
            <text class="snap-meta">课表 {{item.courseCount}} 门 · 成绩 {{item.gradeCount}} 条</text>
          </view>
          <view class="snap-restore" data-idx="{{index}}" bindtap="restoreSnap">恢复</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="p-btns" wx:if="{{snapList.length}}">
        <view class="btn-ghost" bindtap="clearSnapList">删除全部快照</view>
        <view class="btn-primary" bindtap="closeSnapshots">关闭</view>
      </view>
      <view class="p-btns" wx:else>
        <view class="btn-primary" bindtap="closeSnapshots">知道了</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
